The Streamr components are unmodified except for these Pombo patches:

- packages/node/src/plugins/storage/ — ingest validation, signed reads, purge,
  the storedAt column, automatic retention, and the capabilities and metadata
  endpoints (IngestValidator, signedReads, purgeEndpoint, SignedRequest,
  PomboGates, RetentionScheduler, Storage, DataQueryFormat, dataMetadataEndpoint,
  capabilitiesEndpoint, StoragePlugin).
- packages/node/bin/streamr-storage-node-register.ts — creates the node's
  assignment stream and adds a --print-address mode.
- packages/sdk/src/StreamrClient.ts — adds validateMessage() and
  getMessageSigner(), used by the node to validate messages at ingest.
- Build and deployment: Dockerfile.node, deploy/, bootstrap.sh, HOW_TO_INSTALL.md,
  POMBO.md.

Everything else is Streamr's, unmodified.
